{%- comment -%}
  PDP recommendations — one product card (Section Rendering API only; no
  presets, so it never appears in the theme editor).

  Rendered on a product URL: /products/<handle>?section_id=pdp-rec-card
  The PDP script picks the closest gems via sections/pdp-recs-index.liquid,
  fetches this for each winner and moves the .product-card into the
  "You May Also Like" grid, so the card markup stays the shared snippet.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product -%}
  {% render 'product-card', product: product %}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PDP recommendation card"
}
{% endschema %}
